# README gap 8 -- FIXED 2026-08-27. "Every service port must be unique"
# is an org rule this model could not state: unique() compared WHOLE
# children, so two services differing in any other field passed, and
# nothing could PRODUCE the list of ports to check instead (each/pack
# map whole children, `_.port` is unspellable).
#
# unique(port) says it directly -- no projection needed at all, because
# the atom now takes the projector. Expected: [aontu/constraint], the
# duplicate 8080 refused.
fleet: unique(port) & {
  api: { port:8080 image:"acme/api:1" }
  auth: { port:8080 image:"acme/auth:1" }
}
